---
import CookieArt from './CookieArt.astro';
import Icon from './HomeIcon.astro';
const cf=(Astro.request as Request & {cf?:{country?:string}}).cf;
const country=typeof cf?.country==='string'&&/^[A-Z]{2}$/.test(cf.country)?cf.country:'unknown';
---
<section class="jc-storage-notice jc-storage-notice--compact" data-storage-notice data-country={country} aria-labelledby="jc-notice-title" hidden><CookieArt/><div class="jc-storage-copy"><h2 id="jc-notice-title">Your cookie choices</h2><p>Essential storage keeps the site working. With your permission, Adsterra may use connection details and cookies to show and measure ads. Optional advertising requires an 18-or-older declaration. No audience analytics. <a href="/cookies/">Details</a></p></div><div class="jc-storage-actions jc-cookie-equal"><button type="button" data-cookie-essentials>Essentials only</button><button type="button" data-cookie-all>Accept all</button><button type="button" data-storage-settings>Customize</button></div></section>
<dialog class="jc-storage-dialog" data-storage-dialog aria-labelledby="jc-storage-title"><div class="jc-storage-dialog-top"><CookieArt/><button type="button" data-storage-close aria-label="Close cookie preferences"><Icon name="close" size={20}/></button></div><p class="support-kicker">YOUR PRIVACY</p><h2 id="jc-storage-title">Cookie preferences</h2><p>Browse, download and create with optional cookies off. Accepting all enables Adsterra advertising only after an 18-or-older declaration. You can change this choice here at any time.</p><div class="jc-storage-category"><div><strong>Essential storage</strong><span>Security and your cookie choices. Your artwork is saved when you choose.</span></div><b>Always active</b></div><label class="jc-storage-category"><span><strong>Optional advertising</strong><span>Adsterra receives connection information, such as your IP address, browser details and page address, and may use cookies or similar identifiers to deliver and measure ads. No audience analytics service.</span></span><input type="checkbox" data-cookie-advertising/></label><fieldset class="jc-cookie-age" data-cookie-age-group><legend>Age range</legend><p>This is a self-declaration, not identity verification. We do not ask for a date of birth. No advertising service loads for an unknown age, Under 18 or Prefer not to say.</p><div><label><input type="radio" name="cookie-age" value="under18" data-cookie-age/>Under 18</label><label><input type="radio" name="cookie-age" value="adult" data-cookie-age/>18 or older</label><label><input type="radio" name="cookie-age" value="private" data-cookie-age/>Prefer not to say</label></div><p data-cookie-age-status></p></fieldset><p>Cookie permission is remembered for up to 180 days. An explicit 18-or-older declaration is remembered only in this tab for this session, for at most 24 hours. We store no date of birth or under-age answer. We do not include the declaration in advertising requests; third-party code runs under its own privacy policy.</p><p><a href="/privacy/#advertising">Privacy details</a> · <a href="https://adsterra.com/privacy-policy-managed/" rel="external noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Adsterra privacy policy</a></p><p class="jc-storage-warning">Turning off loaded advertising reloads the page to stop its code. If this page has unsaved changes, you can stay and save them first. No form values or artwork are copied to do this.</p><p data-storage-choice role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="jc-storage-actions jc-cookie-equal"><button type="button" data-cookie-essentials>Essentials only</button><button type="button" data-cookie-all>Accept all</button><button type="button" data-cookie-save>Save preferences</button></div></dialog>
<script>import {mountStorageNotice} from '../privacy/controller';mountStorageNotice();</script>
